me there's an update I come back and it's always as fun as the first time. Everyone in my group has their own playing style and gets enjoyment from the game in their own way - mine is relaxing, catch pals at my own pace, and pet each one daily in my base. They're my buddies.. my pals if you will. <3", "timestamp_created": 1784159777, "timestamp_updated": 1784159777, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230570133", "author": {"steamid": "76561198133295376", "personaname": "Newt Daddy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/garadios/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 15371, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13046, "last_played": 1785255858, "avatar": "3264eb98d983b62854a08c6484930789771a008f"}, "language": "english", "review": "absolutely fantastic. 1.0 added allot and improved every aspect of the game. if you like survival games and monster tamer this is huge.", "timestamp_created": 1784159691, "timestamp_updated": 1784159691, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32653", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 3800X 8-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 SUPER", "vram_size": 8006}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230570086", "author": {"steamid": "76561199156207512", "personaname": "akratch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199156207512/", "num_games_