568980", "author": {"steamid": "76561199072372378", "personaname": "boba", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/buwup/", "num_games_owned": 42, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 6066, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1767, "last_played": 1786170437, "avatar": "69efc20dcb3369c7ce15dba9d70ccf54cb5b532c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I got this gifted to me, and didn't touch it for like two years, but recently got into it because my friends were playing and I wanted to join. It was surprisingly pretty fun, and I am playing on easy mode with people who have already played before and are kind of sweating. I'd say so it probably does affect my playstyle a lot compared to others. I am thinking of starting a run on my own to see if I can do it myself ish, but it looks very overwhelming and complex as a new player. I really enjoy catching random stuff and the survival aspect.", "timestamp_created": 1784158237, "timestamp_updated": 1784158237, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "230568961", "author": {"steamid": "76561198182989518", "personaname": "TympanicLemon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dannyazapata/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 346, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 252, "last_played": 1784170952, "avatar": "da30241def33fad6261a7996dbd3aa5609faf44e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nice job my dudes", "timestamp_created": 1784158218, "timestamp_updated": 1784158218, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false,